{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "3929b7c71a2f6a8a6ab59d0cd7cdbd3f384cda5a4347256fab3c16917cb71cff", "ja": "えへ……えへへへへ～♪", "zh": "诶嘿……诶嘿嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b5767c208de5510f78f94979fb6f5d0f7a10074257dd0da1efd30a5e17119eb2", "ja": "お疲れさま、真。\n新しい衣装の確認に来たんだけど……おっ。", "zh": "辛苦了，真。\n我是来确认新服装的……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "6eea3159f8dd02c3278adbeba14e4302f55352ec0185d9575d4bd5dedaf71663", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nどうです、この衣装？　似合ってますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你觉得这套服装怎么样？适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "311cddeb9d6c84c27e03c8d9ae2a452cf3a0109efa401c6ff475566a15b4dcff", "ja": "ああ、似合ってるよ。\n真にピッタリだな！", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n和小真简直是绝配！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "c58f4c9b44b0840de5b02c0b0ccef7911b369f62f5436a8e80ec232a1533548c", "ja": "やーりぃ！　実はボクもそう思ってるんです！\n……なーんて、えへへ～♪", "zh": "太好啦！其实我也是这么想的！\n……才怪，嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "d565cdb678a5867f3e17694939902cb81d1827b268d36a40b9a7d30f9c250042", "ja": "特攻隊長の役って聞いたから、\nゴツゴツした衣装を覚悟してたんですけど……。", "zh": "听说我要演冲锋队长的角色，所以已经做好穿上硬朗风格服装的心理准备了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "1d28e69b2a5616978e29ba8a96cb05a6feec7adde10c73d6140744efbacbb34b", "ja": "でも届いたのが、すごくセクシーな衣装だったから、\nボク、とっても嬉しくて……！", "zh": "不过送来的却是非常性感的服装，所以我特别开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5d1e88b614ce675251f0f5d9f09f9537d4c69877aadcf1fc95bbb54df71f58cd", "ja": "喜んでもらえて、何よりだよ。\nそれより、着てみて気になるところはないか？", "zh": "你能喜欢就再好不过了。\n比起这个，试穿之后有没有觉得哪里不对劲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "a59e5b7b73622403a69eb534b49a107a8895b5bef75b2b8e5de8847eb9014218", "ja": "着心地はバツグンです！\nあ、でも……耐久力がちょっと心配かな？", "zh": "穿起来的感觉棒极了！\n啊，不过……耐久性方面有点让人担心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "350a3f2798c88e799f9e77300d834b29274fa751939f6551dd795712e4b7fde4", "ja": "……耐久力？", "zh": "……耐磨程度？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "89eef855ad7f823538f37b9bcf0ed1f180777dab0a4f6df4fafa8eef1eb599ec", "ja": "はい。今回の役は、アクションも派手ですし、\nボクの動きに耐えられるかなって……。", "zh": "是的。这次的角色动作也很华丽，我是在想，这套服装能不能承受住我的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "10d8bb6bb99009af65e79ae8e5f7ea6e4dd61a416e44b1c68db093a9bc7d3c07", "ja": "そういうことなら、大丈夫だよ。\n真の運動能力を考えて、この衣装を作ったからな。", "zh": "既然这样，就没问题了。我考虑到真的运动能力，才制作了这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "39b25198b3ea32c7b57b54e3ee8676a7079d7bd3e6d0d97c9cbb4e4af48dd04c", "ja": "本当ですか、{$P$}！\nよかった。じゃあ、テストを兼ねて……。", "zh": "真的吗，{$P$}！\n太好了。那么，就顺便测试一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "aefcd5cd73f8c473d8428dcfbe970f738e150e7b79dbcbece53748ab8bf02a6c", "ja": "そのまま、動かずに立っててもらっていいですか？\nそう、目を閉じて……動くと危ないですよ。", "zh": "请就这样站着别动，可以吗？\n对，闭上眼睛……乱动的话会很危险哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "04e8c247ce4ab4faf64602e76d6bf59f3d5370911c953df0db573d4c503994b8", "ja": "セイッ！　ハッ！　ヤーッ！", "zh": "嘿！哈！呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "387506a579308d0557032360ac9fd3be10bce32b63a5aac3b6ffa73be09fa13c", "ja": "（！？　すごい風圧を感じる……。上から……。\nこ、今度は下の方……わ、顔の真横……！？）", "zh": "（！？感觉到一股好强的风压……从上面……接、接下来又是下面……哇，就在脸的正侧面……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "20c79bb8cf4fb8911492f8299922f83dee2d9ac79af1a8fb63a54ea6a3ff4be4", "ja": "とりゃあーーーっ！", "zh": "喝呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "0759d3a07ae7e7a57eddd91f30f94d70be7daa8c32efe2b531df9d2f2ab4c493", "ja": "スゥー、ハァー……。", "zh": "吸气，呼气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "9e6a569364dda870695ab38fd9204207fd96166faab6783695465f88c759fe1c", "ja": "すごいです、{$P$}！\nどんな動きにもフィットして、破けませんよ！", "zh": "太厉害了，{$P$}！\n无论做什么动作都很合身，而且不会破哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7301aa3247f0614f9475ea313aa68a9b494378bb28b06343b394966351d02b3c", "ja": "……アクションは、真の持ち味だからな。\n特別に、丈夫な素材を使ってもらったんだ。", "zh": "……因为动作戏是你的强项嘛。\n所以我特意让人用了结实的材料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "db0ff0c6cc7b0363e7b550912819af2be04e5121d8a6c06c732c8f15ca3bc44c", "ja": "そこまで、ボクのことを考えて……！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "居然为我考虑到这种地步……！谢谢您，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "6f7ef3a618f1c6b727e3f730f838c7df040309cb0854752477827133b5e6925a", "ja": "よかった。これで安心して、全力が出せます！\n衣装が気になって、ずっと力をセーブしてたから……。", "zh": "太好了。这样一来就能放心使出全力了！\n之前总是在意服装，一直都在保留实力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3945fb62d7ab55c24c8374a21100014af9f8b2b5894d4a3c360206daccbf22c1", "ja": "え、今までは、全力じゃなかったのか？", "zh": "诶，刚才一直没使出全力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "5214cf8351d2b4d83da4c45486c6911a653e98f52fd76c0052006d107e5528b8", "ja": "はい！　さっきのも、テストを兼ねてたから、\nだいたい70パーセントぐらいですね。", "zh": "是！刚才那次也兼作测试，所以大概只有70％左右吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "2cb5731cb885bcf53ac9572af59d93069ebc1456bbec98a7d452a7869e347e1b", "ja": "でも今回は、遠慮なく全力でいきます！\n最高のアクション、ビシッと決めてみせますね！", "zh": "不过这次，我会毫不客气地全力以赴！\n一定会把最棒的动作完美呈现给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ed367687616b9614a1798f4b778e2110be443dd6d449a3824c4b29fb130ecac7", "ja": "そ、そうか！　真の100パーセント全力の\nアクション、俺も楽しみだよ。", "zh": "哦、这样啊！我也很期待真使出100％全力的动作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0114_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7f11a5dcc4958edc742dfa884d59c70f9a0ddf911c0b039ec900fc02043adc6f", "ja": "（……今後は、真の120パーセントにも耐えられる\nような衣装を、仕上げてもらわないとな、うん）", "zh": "（……今后得让他们做好能承受真那120％全力以赴的服装才行，嗯）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
